            <ArticleTitle>Risk Factors for the Development of Nonalcoholic Fatty Liver Disease/Nonalcoholic Steatohepatitis, Including Genetics.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>39-57</MedlinePgn>
